  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/seamless/Seamless2.png\" alt=\"Seamless\"></p>\n<p>一个客户端数据驱动的模组，用于连接双格方块的轮廓，例如门和床。该模组完全可通过资源包进行配置，允许任何组合方块（无论其大小）拥有一个统一的大轮廓。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/architectury-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"architectury-api\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric API\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>支持连接轮廓的方块：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>门</li>\n<li>床</li>\n<li>大型箱子（双层箱）</li>\n<li>大型植物，如高草、牡丹和捕蝇草</li>\n<li>小型垂滴叶</li>\n<li>活塞</li>\n<li>高海草</li>\n<li>捕蝇草作物</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em><strong>大多数模组添加的植物、门、箱子和床也应该可以正常工作！</strong></em></p>\n<h3>完全由数据驱动！</h3>\n<p>这意味着您可以通过简单的资源包自行添加对任何模组的兼容性。<br>\n想了解如何操作吗？请查看<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.teamdiopside.nl%252fseamless%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">文档</a>。</p>\n<h3>内置兼容性包括：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Create (机械动力)</strong>（玻璃门、火车门、黄铜门、铜门和安山岩门）</li>\n<li><strong>Supplementaries (附属物品)</strong>（亚麻、弹簧发射器）</li>\n<li><strong>Fast Paintings (快速画作)</strong>（画作）</li>\n<li><strong>Farmer's Delight (农夫乐事)</strong>（水稻、完整榻榻米垫）</li>\n<li><strong>Haunted Harvest (恐怖丰收)</strong>（玉米）</li>\n<li><strong>Sleep Tight (安睡)</strong>（吊床、夜用袋）</li>\n<li><strong>Waystones (传送石)</strong>（传送石）</li>\n<li><strong>Upgrade Aquatic (水生升级)</strong>（睡袋、开花灯心草、泽泻、海滩草）</li>\n<li><strong>Biomes o' Plenty (多元生物群系)</strong>（硫磺簇、眼球果）</li>\n<li><strong>Environmental (环境)</strong>（香蒲、大型和巨型睡莲、高大枯灌木）</li>\n<li><strong>Atmospheric (大气)</strong>（水葫芦、丝兰花朵）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>有建议吗？请告诉我！</em></p>\n<h3>其他模组自行添加了兼容性：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Comforts (舒适)</strong>（睡袋、吊床）</li>\n<li><strong>Dramatic Doors (戏剧之门)</strong>（高门）</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/seamless/compare.png\" alt=\"On and off\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/seamless/door_flower.png\" alt=\"Door and Flower\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/PJCXjSJnu2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/diopside/Serverbanner.png\" alt=\"Team Diopside Discord\"></a></p>",
